<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA to SNCF's dual samurai bond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA to SNCF's dual samurai bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday that it had assigned an AAA rating to French state railways group SNCF's 30 billion yen 4.7 percent yen/dollar dual-currency samurai bond due on June 27, 2000.</p>
<p>The outlook was stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
